From {{etyl|ML.}} {{term|registrarius|lang=la}}, from {{term|registrum||register|lang=la}} + {{term|-arius||agent|lang=la}}. See more at {{term|register|lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[official]] [[keeper]], or [[recorder]] of [[record]]s.
